  <!-- No <option> existed anywhere in this model before -- meant relying on
       MuJoCo's own default timestep (0.002s), which happens to already
       match the commonly-recommended value for stiff robot-gripper contacts,
       but that was never verified, just assumed. Making it explicit (plus
       solver/jacobian) so it's a checkable fact instead of an assumption,
